WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.076 --> 00:00:07.606
Today was the day.

2
00:00:07.607 --> 00:00:10.655
Cora was going to visit Octo.

3
00:00:10.656 --> 00:00:13.760
But something didn't feel right.

4
00:00:13.761 --> 00:00:18.047
"Maybe I shouldn't go," Cora thought.

5
00:00:18.048 --> 00:00:22.209
Mo swam into Cora's den.

6
00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:26.169
"Aren't you going to visit Octo?" he asked.

7
00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:29.956
"I don't know," Cora said.

8
00:00:29.957 --> 00:00:35.219
"What if something happens while I'm gone?"

9
00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:39.822
"The compass will help us," Mo said.

10
00:00:39.823 --> 00:00:43.037
"You don't have ink," Cora said.

11
00:00:43.038 --> 00:00:45.753
"It won't open for you."

12
00:00:45.754 --> 00:00:50.934
Mo sighed. "Oh . . . right."

13
00:00:50.935 --> 00:00:54.190
"I'll stay," Cora said.

14
00:00:54.191 --> 00:00:59.398
"No," Mo said. "Go visit your family.

15
00:00:59.399 --> 00:01:02.658
I'll watch the reef."

16
00:01:02.659 --> 00:01:07.684
Mo puffed up big. "See?

17
00:01:07.685 --> 00:01:11.829
I can scare enemies away."

18
00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:18.941
Cora laughed. "Okay, I'll go."

19
00:01:18.942 --> 00:01:24.917
Cora and Mo swam out of her den.

20
00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:30.992
Parrot fish were cleaning the reef.

21
00:01:30.993 --> 00:01:35.027
"Great job," Cora said.

22
00:01:35.028 --> 00:01:39.043
"Thanks!" the parrot fish said.

23
00:01:39.044 --> 00:01:42.432
Cora waved good-bye to Mo.

24
00:01:42.433 --> 00:01:47.415
But then she saw Wanda racing toward her.

25
00:01:47.416 --> 00:01:52.004
"Wait, Cora!" Wanda called.

26
00:01:52.005 --> 00:01:55.078
"I feel something shaking.

27
00:01:55.079 --> 00:01:58.087
An earthquake is coming!"

28
00:01:58.088 --> 00:02:03.709
"Oh no!" Cora said. "I'll warn everyone!"

29
00:02:03.710 --> 00:02:10.118
"No," Wanda said. "There's not enough time.

30
00:02:10.119 --> 00:02:14.914
A wave could sweep you away!"

